     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Lrg bowel:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " periph “picture frame”; haustra do ⍉cross the full diameter; "
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       },
       {
        "type": "highlight",
        "attrs": {
         "hex": "FF0000"
        }
       }
      ],
      "text": "dilated > 6 cm (> 9 cm @ the cecum)"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Perf can occur w marked dilate; the risk = ↑if the "
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       },
       {
        "type": "highlight",
        "attrs": {
         "hex": "FF0000"
        }
       }
      ],
      "text": "cecum = ≥ 13 cm"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 0,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": 0,
     "spaceBefore": 6,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": null
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Eti"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Colon: tumors (USU Lt colon), diverticulitis (USU sigmoid), volvulus of the sigmoid or cecum, fecal impaction, Hirschsprung dz, Crohn dz"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Strangulation = rare in large-bowel obstruct (except w volvulus)"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 0,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": 0,
     "spaceBefore": 6,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": null
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Sx"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "USU milder and more gradual than SBO: increasing constipation → obstipation and distention; vomiting may occur (USU several hrs later) but = ⍉common; lower abd cramps w.o passing stool"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Exam typically: distended abd w loud borborygmi, ⍉tenderness, rectum USU empty; a mass @ an obstructing tumor may be palpable"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 0,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": 0,
     "spaceBefore": 6,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": null
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Tx and next step"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Her chart:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " CT; surg consult"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Supportive care as for SBO: nasogastric suction, IVF and a urinary cath to monitor output"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Obstructing colon CA: sometimes a single-stage resection and anastomosis (± a temp colostomy or ileostomy); otherwise a diverting colostomy w delayed resection"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Obstruct from diverticulitis: perf = often present; removal = indicated w perf and gen peritonitis — resection and colostomy, w anastomosis often postponed"
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
